<title>PORTUGAL: BASKETBALL-SPANISH PLAYER DIES IN TRAINING.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-SPANISH PLAYER DIES IN TRAINING.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish basketball player Angel Almeida collapsed and died on Tuesday during training, his Portugal Telecom club said.</p>
<p>Almeida, 24, joined Portugal Telecom last season. The cause of death was not immediately known.</p>
</text>
